--[[
    vanta.lol v6.1 - interface and configuration panel
    Black interface with colored outlines, screen overlays, and user settings.

    Included interface features:
      * RightShift opens/closes the menu and unlocks/restores the mouse cursor.
      * A draggable window with six independently scrollable tabs.
      * Toggles, numeric sliders, cycling dropdowns, and accent-color themes.
      * Optional watermark, FPS counter, and local clock overlay.
      * Save, load, and reset configuration when the executor provides file APIs.
      * Smooth page transitions, adjustable menu scale, compact layout, and background opacity.

    All gameplay-related switches start disabled and can be changed from the menu.
    The interface uses a black background while retaining the selected accent color on outlines.
    The hitbox option is a local visual adornment; it does not change server-side character physics.
    This header documents the script and does not change its runtime behavior.
]]

